  "line": "pops a balloon out of your head."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "s": 3.48,
  "e": 4.73,
  "line": "Get enough, and you float."
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "s": 4.73,
  "e": 6.76,
  "line": "That's why popular kids float to their parties,"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "s": 6.76,
  "e": 8.04,
  "line": "and forgotten kids walk."
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "s": 8.04,
  "e": 9.21,
  "line": "Today was my birthday."
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "s": 9.21,
  "e": 10.61,
  "line": "I was hoping for ten balloons."
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "s": 10.61,
  "e": 11.96,
  "line": "But my best friend Oscar"
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "s": 11.96,
  "e": 13.08,
  "line": "had the same birthday,"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "s": 13.08,
  "e": 14.27,
  "line": "and nobody ever remembered."
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "s": 14.27,
  "e": 16.15,
  "line": "He'd never blown out a single candle."
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "s": 16.15,
  "e": 18.41,
  "line": "Meanwhile, Bianca had so many balloons"
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "s": 18.41,
  "e": 19.46,
  "line": "she needed a seatbelt."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "s": 19.46,
  "e": 20.59,
  "line": "She floated to school."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "s": 20.59,
  "e": 21.68,
  "line": "She floated to lunch."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "s": 21.68,
  "e": 22.93,
  "line": "She floated into a tree."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "s": 22.93,
  "e": 23.96,
  "line": "Then my grandma called."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "s": 23.96,
  "e": 25.13,
  "line": "Happy birthday, sweetie."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "s": 25.13,
  "e": 26.64,
  "line": "Pop. My first balloon."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "s": 26.64,
  "e": 28.11,
  "line": "And that's when I had an idea."
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "s": 28.11,
  "e": 29.09,
  "line": "If I got enough wishes,"
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "s": 29.09,
  "e": 30.56,
  "line": "I could fly over the whole town."
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "s": 30.56,
  "e": 32.59,
  "line": "I wished myself happy birthday. Nothing."
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "s": 32.59,
  "e": 34.56,
  "line": "I wore a sign that said, birthday boy."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "s": 34.56,
  "e": 35.49,
  "line": "People just read it."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "s": 35.49,
  "e": 37.25,
  "line": "Then I held the door for the whole class,"
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "s": 37.25,
  "e": 38.42,
  "line": "and they all sang to me."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "s": 38.42,
  "e": 40.12,
  "line": "Pop, pop, pop. Eight balloons."
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "s": 40.12,
  "e": 41.19,
  "line": "The bus driver honked it."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "s": 41.19,
  "e": 42.35,
  "line": "The lunch lady sang it."
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "s": 42.35,
  "e": 43.66,
  "line": "Even my dog barked it."
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "s": 43.66,
  "e": 45.79,
  "line": "By sunset, I was floating over the street."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "s": 45.79,
  "e": 47.55,
  "line": "Then I looked down and saw Oscar,"
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "s": 47.55,
  "e": 49.24,
  "line": "on his steps. Zero balloons."
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "s": 49.24,
  "e": 50.99,
  "line": "Same birthday. Nobody remembered."
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "s": 50.99,
  "e": 52.48,
  "line": "I'd spent all day collecting wishes"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "s": 52.48,
  "e": 53.82,
  "line": "while my best friend got none."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "s": 53.82,
  "e": 54.7,
  "line": "So I floated down"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "s": 54.7,
  "e": 55.95,
  "line": "and gave him all my balloons."
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "s": 55.95,
  "e": 57.23,
  "line": "Happy birthday, Oscar."
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "s": 57.23,
  "e": 59.23,
  "line": "Then I yelled, it's his birthday too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "s": 59.23,
  "e": 60.29,
  "line": "Pop, pop, pop."
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "s": 60.29,
  "e": 62.88,
  "line": "That night, Oscar blew out his first candles."
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "s": 62.88,
  "e": 64.1,
  "line": "Then he looked at me and said,"
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "s": 64.1,
  "e": 65.53,
